DESCRIPTION:The Pensacola Symphony Orchestra holds its annual celebration 
 of Beethoven on Saturday\, January 9\, and invites the audience to dress 
 up or dress down. Classical guitarist Jason Vieaux joins the orchestra fo
 r Rodrigo's Concierto de Aranjuez. The program also includes Beethoven's 
 Leonore Overture No. 3\, Smetana's The Moldau and Ginastera's dances from
